---
// Not in 03-PAGE-SPECS. Required by 07-COMPLIANCE/trakheesi-and-claims.md:73 — the
// valuation form collects an owner's name, phone and property details before any
// engagement exists, so the notice has to be live before the form is.
//
// This is a scaffold with the right sections, not legal copy. That file says: "have the
// client's counsel confirm the privacy notice before the form goes live."
import UtilityLayout from '../../layouts/UtilityLayout.astro';
import NeedsSource from '../../components/NeedsSource.astro';
import { SITE, token } from '../../lib/site.js';
---

<UtilityLayout
  title="Privacy notice — Plainly"
  description="How Plainly handles the 4 details submitted through the valuation request form: what is collected, who it is shared with, how long it is kept, and your rights."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <p>
    This notice is a scaffold and has not been reviewed by counsel. It must not go live in
    this state, and the form it covers does not accept submissions until it has:{' '}
    <NeedsSource what="privacy notice reviewed against UAE federal data protection law by the client's counsel" />
  </p>

  <h2>Who is the controller?</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name}, contact <span class="pending">{token(SITE.email, 'EMAIL')}</span>. The
    registered entity name and address of the controller are required here:{' '}
    <NeedsSource what="registered controller entity name and address" />
  </p>

  <h2>What is collected?</h2>
  <p>Through the valuation request form:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your name</li>
    <li>Your phone number</li>
    <li>The community your property is in</li>
    <li>The property type</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    The indicative range tool collects nothing. It runs in your browser and no request leaves
    the page.
  </p>

  <h2>Why is it collected?</h2>
  <p>
    To produce and deliver the written valuation you asked for, and to contact you about that
    request. Nothing else.
  </p>

  <h2>Who is it shared with?</h2>
  <p>
    The RERA-licensed partner brokerage that produces the valuation, because they cannot
    produce it otherwise. Nobody else, and it is not sold, rented or used for unrelated
    marketing.
  </p>

  <h2>How long is it kept?</h2>
  <p>
    A stated retention period is required rather than "as long as necessary":{' '}
    <NeedsSource what="retention period agreed with the client and their counsel" />
  </p>

  <h2>What are your rights?</h2>
  <p>
    Under UAE federal data protection law you have rights over the data held about you,
    including access, correction and erasure. The exercisable rights and the process for
    exercising them must be stated specifically:{' '}
    <NeedsSource what="rights and exercise process, confirmed against UAE Federal Decree-Law on data protection" />
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    What is set, by whom, and on what legal basis is required here once analytics is
    configured:{' '}
    <NeedsSource what="analytics and cookie inventory, once GA4 is live" />
  </p>
</UtilityLayout>
